---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What this is." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About this Mastering Primary</h1>

			<p>
				I have been practicing Ashtanga Yoga off and on for 25 years. I
				practiced every day for a year. I practiced regularly for a couple of
				years in a row. I practiced in India with Pattabhi Jois (the originator
				of Ashtanga yoga), and later with Sharath (his grandson). I even lived
				in a yoga ashram for an extended period of time. I have still never
				managed to develop a credible Primary Series. As implied by the name,
				the Primary Series is the starting point for an Ashtanga practice. In
				any reasonable assessment, this is an astounding failure. It is also a
				failure that influences many areas of my life.
			</p>

			<p>
				Your equivalent could be the book you haven't written, the business you
				haven't started, the relationship you haven't developed, the equity you
				haven't accumulated. It is the intention you live with but persistently
				don't fulfill.
			</p>

			<p>
				Yoga helpfully provides a guidebook to meet our intentions. I expect
				the guidebook is broadly applicable to any complex personal endeavour.
			</p>

			<p>
				This site follows my journey using this guidebook to dig myself out of
				a hole, to develop a life of meaning, to find meaning in the life I am
				living. Through this journey I intend to develop the baseline skills
				required to live a rewarding life and I intend to also find the thrill
				and ecstasy of living closer to god.
			</p>

			<p>Along the way I will also develop a graceful Primary Series.</p>

			<p class="meta">
				No comments. <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> and
				<a href="/subscribe">email</a> if you want to follow along.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			.meta {
				margin-top: 3rem;
				padding-top: 1.5rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: var(--ink-muted);
			}
			.meta a {
				color: var(--ink-muted);
			}
			.meta a:hover {
				color: var(--ink);
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
